        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"title\": \"5 AI Tools You Should Know in 2026\",\n  \"hook\": \"These five AI tools could completely change how you work.\",\n  \"cta\": \"Follow for more AI content.\",\n  \"full_script\": \"AI is moving incredibly fast right now, and if you are not paying attention you are already behind. Here are five tools that are quietly changing how people work every single day...\",\n  \"scenes\": [\n    {\n      \"scene_number\": 1,\n      \"caption\": \"These five AI tools could completely change how you work.\",\n      \"visual_prompt\": \"First-person POV GoPro shot of hands typing rapidly on a laptop keyboard in a dim home office, screen glow reflecting off focused, determined eyes. In the background, city lights blur through a rain-streaked window, a second monitor pulses with shifting data visualizations, the mood restless and electric.\",\n      \"duration\": 5\n    },\n    {\n      \"scene_number\": 2,\n      \"caption\": \"Tool number one changes everything.\",\n      \"visual_prompt\": \"First-person POV GoPro shot of a hand reaching toward a glowing holographic interface hovering above a desk. In the background, soft blue light washes over a cluttered desk of notebooks and coffee cups, dust motes drifting through a single warm lamp beam, calm but charged with anticipation.\",\n      \"duration\": 5\n    }\n  ]\n}"
